msgstr "Seleccionar el desired network servidor integration (e.g., NSX-T)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:30
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:49
